From caf4f9e1d1739927eb05a61ad9021a4c167810c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:41:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add Esperanto message catalogs for postgres, psql and
 libpq.

Local demo only, not intended for upstream.  Machine translated from
fresh templates in chunks against a shared glossary, and checked with
msgfmt -c.  Entries that could not be made to pass are left
untranslated and fall back to English.

Select with LANGUAGE=eo plus any non-C LC_MESSAGES; clients also need
a UTF-8 LC_CTYPE, or the Esperanto letters come out as "?".
---
 src/backend/po/LINGUAS          |     2 +-
 src/backend/po/eo.po            | 35617 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/bin/psql/po/LINGUAS         |     2 +-
 src/bin/psql/po/eo.po           |  7587 +++++++
 src/interfaces/libpq/po/LINGUAS |     2 +-
 src/interfaces/libpq/po/eo.po   |  2238 ++
 6 files changed, 45445 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/backend/po/eo.po
 create mode 100644 src/bin/psql/po/eo.po
 create mode 100644 src/interfaces/libpq/po/eo.po

diff --git a/src/backend/po/LINGUAS b/src/backend/po/LINGUAS
index 3481e736afa..54cf849eee5 100644
--- a/src/backend/po/LINGUAS
+++ b/src/backend/po/LINGUAS
@@ -1 +1 @@
-de es fr id it ja ka ko pl pt_BR ru sv tr uk zh_CN en@piglatin
+de es fr id it ja ka ko pl pt_BR ru sv tr uk zh_CN en@piglatin eo
diff --git a/src/backend/po/eo.po b/src/backend/po/eo.po
new file mode 100644
